# WCHNTMaths on the live CLI

Same roll as `examples/maths.wcn`. Target is `%cli-live`.
`wchntMaths` is the host handle; press Enter to roll.

## Schema

```
Trio = Int/a Int/b Int/c
Roll = @WCHNTMaths/maths
```

## Construction

```
[:Roll maths]
```

## Methods

```
Roll::once = {
  r1 = maths.randInt(10).
  r2 = maths.randInt(10).
  r3 = maths.randInt(10).
  [:Trio r1 r2 r3]
}

Roll::wave = { maths.sin(0) }
```

## Target

```
%cli-live

%requires
WCHNTMaths::randInt(Int) -> Int
WCHNTMaths::sin(Float) -> Float

%init
var roll;

function init() {
    roll = RollAssemblage.factory(wchntMaths);
    wchntConsole.println("enter to roll");
}

%step
function step(line) {
    wchntConsole.println(roll.once());
    wchntConsole.println(roll.wave());
}
```
